{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_adr_020_dashboards_and_role_templates", "label": "ADR-020 Dashboards: wizard, persona templates, widget catalogue; Horizon refinements", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-020-dashboards-and-role-templates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_020_dashboards_and_role_templates_dashboard_contract", "label": "Dashboard contract 0.1.0 (packages/contracts/src/dashboard.ts)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-020-dashboards-and-role-templates.md", "source_location": "packages/contracts/src/dashboard.ts", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Five personas, twenty-four widget kinds grouped by source screen, four sizes on a four-column grid, persona templates whose sizes complete rows; the console renders a kind, the API validates it, a template is the same list on both sides. A new widget is a minor contract bump."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_020_dashboards_and_role_templates_dashboard_wizard", "label": "Dashboard wizard and customisation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-020-dashboards-and-role-templates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Syed asked for a wizard and customisation first, then real use-case dashboards for Administrator, CTO/CIO, CISO and Finance, with Mantine, Gentelella and Haze dashboards as cues but 'don't use as is'. The sign-in walkthrough still lands on an h1 Dashboard so T-087 and Lighthouse flow are unchanged."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_020_dashboards_and_role_templates_persona_templates", "label": "Persona templates (Admin, CTO/CIO, CISO, Finance)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-020-dashboards-and-role-templates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_020_dashboards_and_role_templates_widget_registry", "label": "components/dashboard/widgets.tsx widget registry", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-020-dashboards-and-role-templates.md", "source_location": "apps/console/src/components/dashboard/widgets.tsx", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every widget reads live queries (the aggregate or the screen's own); none carries static data; widgets link to the screen they summarise."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_020_dashboards_and_role_templates_estate_stats", "label": "Query.estateStats aggregate (GraphQL 0.10.0)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-020-dashboards-and-role-templates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One aggregate the widgets read in a single round trip: register counts, purchase totals per stage, licence and vulnerability facts, plans, rack power, subnet utilisation, Nodes, integrations, open incidents and the ClickHouse daily trend over DASHBOARD.trendDays. Money totals per currency, never mixed. Cached per tenant for DASHBOARD.refreshMs by the console's query client, not the API."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_020_dashboards_and_role_templates_dashboards_table", "label": "dashboards Postgres table (migration 0014)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-020-dashboards-and-role-templates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Owner edits and deletes; shared is readable by the tenant; the first dashboard a user creates is their default until they choose another."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_020_dashboards_and_role_templates_om_float", "label": "om-float opt-in floating surfaces", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-020-dashboards-and-role-templates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Opt-in because a transform makes a stacking context and a card holding a dropdown must not float (ADR-018 lesson); reduced motion removes the lift and the idle drift."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_020_dashboards_and_role_templates_svg_primitives", "label": "Sparkline, Donut, Segmented primitives", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-020-dashboards-and-role-templates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SVG only, every number a token or named constant; Sparkline mirrored in rtl; Segmented is a radiogroup."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_020_dashboards_and_role_templates_sora_display_face", "label": "Sora display face", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-020-dashboards-and-role-templates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Geometric and professional at every size, replacing Chakra Petch after Syed asked for more professional type; one token change, one font loader change."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_020_dashboards_and_role_templates_superset_horizon_theme", "label": "Superset Horizon colour scheme and CSS", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-020-dashboards-and-role-templates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Syed found the embedded Superset white against the Horizon console; superset_config.py registers the scheme and the provisioner rewrites dashboard css and json_metadata.color_scheme on every provisioning so existing dashboards update."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_020_dashboards_and_role_templates_req_ui_030", "label": "REQ-UI-030", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-020-dashboards-and-role-templates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null